{'symbol': 'DIS', 'date': '2022-02-28 13:00:00', 'title': 'THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY TO PARTICIPATE IN THE MORGAN STANLEY TECHNOLOGY, MEDIA AND TELECOM CONFERENCE', 'text': 'BURBANK, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CHRISTINE MCCARTHY, SENIOR EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY (NYSE: DIS), WILL PARTICIPATE IN A QUESTION-AND-ANSWER SESSION AT THE MORGAN STANLEY TECHNOLOGY, MEDIA AND TELECOM CONFERENCE ON MONDAY, MARCH 7, 2022 AT APPROXIMATELY 2:25 P.M. PT/ 5:25 P.M. ET. TO LISTEN TO THE WEBCAST, PLEASE VISIT WWW.DISNEY.COM/INVESTORS. THE WEBCAST PRESENTATION WILL BE ARCHIVED.'}